      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It would be nice to have a sort of index list, and selecting each index will get you all the settings for that node.\n\nWhen i was trying it out yesterday a few of the nodes were high in the sky or out of bounds. I was unable to modify settings on those nodes.\n\nMaybe selecting with the laser pointer (like you do on player capsules) might also be a solution?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-02-13T03:20:55.008Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The new camera dolly is amazing. I can not see a way to cycle through different node settings without having to walk up to them to manual adjust them at the node. \n\nCan you add a way to cycle the camera preview window between nodes so we can easily adjust each node setting no matter where we are in the map?  \n\nOverall, amazing job on the dolly system!",
